ely seen any other cartoon  actually pay so much attention to little  things but Coco seems to do this really  well normally cartoons only feature a  set of twins and we never get to learn  about their extended families and how  many twins there are because after all  we all know that having twins is genetic  so if they're common in your family  you're bound to have twins too  the Riviera family shares this detail as  Miguel has twin uncles as well as twin  cousins  Miguel's twin uncle's are tio Felipe and  tio Oscar and twin cousins are the  four-year-olds Vinny and Manny whether  this was intentional or not it's a  pretty cool thing to pay attention to  when you're trying to bring a story to  life a tumblr user hey hey  it's Jude you made an awesome Riviere  family tree where you can clearly see  the relations but we do wonder how far  this family tree actually goes because  we bet there are far more twins in the  Riviere family that we know of and let's  be honest Riviere twins are the best  cartoon twins ever with hardly any  competition from any other movies we're  telling you the detail in this movie is  amazing Finding Nemo guys we finally  found Nemo some of the characters seem  to have escaped the actual Finding Nemo  movie and they appeared in Cocoa after  receive the planet pizza truck Miguel  heads off to start his day and we see  him walk around town isn't it strange  how we get so many references and easter  eggs right at the beginning of the movie  it's a perfect way to make you want to  watch the entire thing anyways Miguel  ventures to the town center where you  can see a table with a bunch of toys on  it but they're not just any toys these  are the toys that characters can  purchase which is probably why they  resemble some of our favorite characters  ever can you find Nemo and Dory Nemo is  located behind the red giraffe on the  left side and Dory can be found in front  of the green dragon they're super small  but we promise you that you'll be abl